<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">ROOM</para>
  <para style="toc1">WAA ROOM</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bataaxal bi Yàlla may Pool, <optbreak /> mu bind ko</para>
  <para style="mt1">WAA ROOM</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Man Pool, jaamub Kirist Yeesu, maa leen di bind bataaxal bii. Yàlla woo na ma, ma nekk ndawam, sas ma liggéeyu xamle xibaaru jàmmam bi. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Xibaaru jàmm boobu, Yàlla dige woon na ko bu yàgg, jaarale ko ciy yonentam, ñu def ko ci Mbind mu sell mi, <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3-4" />di xamle mbirum Doomam, Yeesu Kirist sunu Boroom. Lu jëm ci meloom ci àddina, ci askanu Daawuda la jóge, waaye lu jëm ci xelam mu sell, Doomu Yàlla la; ndaxte ndekkiteem nekk na firnde ju ràññiku, ne moom la. <verse eid="ROM 1:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Te moom Kirist tàbbal na nu ci yiwu Yàlla, def nu ay ndawam, yónni nu ci biir xeeti àddina sépp, ngir ñu gëm ko te jébbalu, ba màggal turam. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Te ci ngeen bokk, yéen ñi Yàlla woo, ngeen nekk ci Kirist.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Yéen ñi dëkk Room ñépp, yéen ñi Yàlla bëgg te woo leen, ngeen nekk gaayam yu sell, na leen Yàlla sunu Baay ak Boroom bi Yeesu Kirist may yiw ak jàmm.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool sant na Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Kon nag li may jëkka wax mooy lii: sant naa Yàlla sama Boroom, jaarale ko ci Yeesu Kirist, ngir yéen ñépp, ndaxte seen ngëm siiw na ci àddina sépp. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Bët bu set maa ngi leen di boole ci samay ñaan. Yàlla seede na li may wax, Yàlla mi may jaamu ci sama xel, ci xamle xibaaru jàmm bu Doomam. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Te li ma koy faral di ñaan mooy lii: bu soobee Yàlla, na ma ubbil bunt, ba ma mana ñëw ci yéen.<verse eid="ROM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Ndaxte bëgg naa leena gis lool, ba indil leen barke bu jóge ci Xel mu Sell mi, ndax seen ngëm gëna dëgër. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Maanaam ma nekk ci seen biir, te nu dimbaleente ci sunu ngëm, ndax man itam ma gëna am doole.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Bokk yi, damaa bëgg ngeen xam ne xalaat naa leena seetsi ay yooni yoon, ngir meññ njariñ ci yéen, ni ma ko defe ci yeneen xeet yi, waaye ay téq-téq ñoo ma téye ba léegi. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Am naa warugar sama diggante ak ñépp, muy ñi jàng ni Gereg yi, muy ñi jàngul ni Baarbaar yi, ñi bare xam-xam ak ñi barewul xam-xam. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Li aju ci man nag, jekk naa ngir ñëw, xamal leen xibaaru jàmm bi, yéen it waa Room.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dooley xibaaru jàmm bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Ndaxte awma benn werante ci xibaaru jàmm bi may waare, ndax mbirum Yàlla la, mu làmboo dooleem, ngir musal képp ku ko gëm, muy Yawut ci bu jëkk mbaa ki dul Yawut. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Ndaxte xibaar bii day wone, ni nit mana jube ci kanam Yàlla, sukkandikoo ci ngëm rekk, tàmbali ci ngëm, yem ci ngëm. Moo tax Mbind mi wax ne: «Ku jub ci kaw ngëm, dinga dund.»<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nit ñépp tooñ nañu Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Merum Yàllaa ngi feeñe asamaan, wàcc ci nit ñi, ndax seen weddi Yàlla gépp ak seen jubadi gépp, ñoom ñi suul dëgg, di topp lu jubadi. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Ndax li nit mana xam ci Yàlla, leer na ci seen xel, ndax Yàlla won na leen ko. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Ndaxte ba àddina sosoo ba tey, mbiri Yàlla yu nëbbu ya, maanaam dooleem ju sax ja, ak meloom wu kawe wa, feeñ nañu bu leer, te bir ñépp ci yi mu sàkk, ba tax bunti lay yépp tëj nañu.<verse eid="ROM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Ndaxte bi ñu xamee Yàlla, taxul ñu màggal ko ni mu ware, mbaa ñu sant ko. Waaye ñu daldi réer ci seen biiri xalaat yu mujjul fenn, ba tax seen xol gumba, ba lëndëm këruus. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Ñu teg seen bopp ni boroomi xel, fekk ñu ñàkk xel lañu woon. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Toxal nañu ndamu Yàlla Aji Sax ji, wuutal fa nataali nit ku dul sax, moom ak ay picc, ay rabi àll mbaa yuy raam.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Moo tax Yàlla bërgël na leen ci seeni bëgg-bëgg, ñu sóobu ciy ñaawteef, di jëflante lu gàccelu ci seeni cér. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Toxal nañu dëggu Yàlla, tëral fen, di màggal ak a jaamu mbindeef, ba faaleetuñu sax Aji Bind, ji yelloo cant ba fàww. Amiin.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Loolu moo tax nag Yàlla bërgël na leen ci seeni bëgg-bëgg yu ruslu. Seeni jigéen sax dëddu nañu li jekk, sóobu ci lu jekkadi, ñoom ak seeni moroom. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Noonu it góor ñi bàyyi nañu li jekk ci seeni cér, maanaam ànd ak jigéen, bay am ay bëgg-bëgg yu tar ci ànd ak seeni moroom. Góor di defante ak góor li warul, ñu di jot seen peyu réer ci seeni yaram.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Gannaaw xam Yàlla soxalu leen, Yàlla it bërgël na leen ci seen xel mu bon moomu, ñu sax ci jëf yu jekkadi. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Seen xol fees na ak lu jubadi, lu bon, bëgge ak coxor; duñu xalaat lu dul kiñaan, bóome, xuloo, njublaŋ ak ñaaw njort; dañuy jëw, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />di yàq der, di ñu bañ Yàlla te ñàkk sutura, di réy-réylu ak a kañu; ay jàmbaar lañu ci fexe lu bon, di bañ seeni waajur. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Amuñu xel, amuñu kóllëre, amuñu cofeel, amuñu yërmande. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Xam nañu ne ñiy jëfe loolu, Yàlla daganal na seen dee, waaye teewul ñu di ko def, boole ko ak di farle ñi ci sax.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Àtteb Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Kon nag képp ku mu mana doon, yaw miy àtte sa moroom ak ñaaw njort, amuloo aw lay, ndaxte àtte sa moroom, daan sa bopp la; yaa ngi koy àtte ndax ay jëfam, fekk yaw itam noonu ngay jëfe. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Xam nanu ne ñiy jëfe noonu, Yàlla dina leen àtte, te àtteem jub na. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Yaw nag miy àtte ñiy def loolu, te di ko def, ndax defe nga ne dinga rëcc ci àtteb Yàlla? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Ndax dangaa xeeb mbaaxu Yàlla, mi yéexa mer te di la muñal? Xanaa xamuloo ne Yàllaa ngi lay won baaxaayam, ngir nga réccu say bàkkaar?<verse eid="ROM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Waaye ndegam dëgër nga bopp te bëgguloo réccu, yaa ngi dajale merum Yàlla ci sa bopp. Ndaxte Yàlla sàkk na bés bu muy wone àtteem bu jub bi te meram wàcc ci ñi bon; <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />bés booba dina delloo ku nekk ay jëfam. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Ñiy góor-góorlu ciy def lu baax, bëgg Yàlla boole leen ca ndamam te sédde leen ngërëm ak dund gu sax, dina leen tàbbal ci dund gu dul jeex. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Waaye ñi dëgër bopp, ba tanqamlu dëgg, di topp lu jubadi, seen pey mooy dooni merum Yàlla ak toroxte. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Ki doon def lu bon, peyam mooy tiis ak metit wu tar, muy Yawut ci bu jëkk, mbaa ki dul Yawut. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Waaye ki doon def lu baax, añam mooy bokk ci ndamu Yàlla, am ngërëm ak jàmm, muy Yawut ci bu jëkk, mbaa ki dul Yawut. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Ndaxte ñépp a yem fa kanam Yàlla.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Képp ku doon bàkkaar nag te nekkuloo woon ci yoonu Musaa, Yàlla dina la àtte ci lu dul yoonu Musaa, nga doora sànku. Te képp ku doon bàkkaar te nga nekkoon ci yoonu Musaa, Yàlla dina la àtte ci yoon woowu. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Kon déglu yoonu Musaa rekk doyul; du loolu mooy tax nit jub ci kanam Yàlla; kiy sàmm yoon wi, moom la Yàlla di àtte ni ku jub. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Ndax ñi dul Yawut te nekkuñu ci yoonu Musaa, ñu ngiy def li yoon woowu tëral, ndaxte Yàlla def na ko ci nit. Te wonee nañu noonu ne man nañoo ràññee lu baax ak lu bon, su ñu nekkul sax ci yoonu Musaa, <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />di wone it ne Yàlla bind na ci seen xol jëf yi yoonu Musaa santaane. Seen xel it seede na ne noonu la, fekk seeni xalaat ñoo leen di tuumaal, mbaa ñu leen di jéggal. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Ndax bés dina ñëw, bu xalaat yu làqu yi di feeñ, te Yàlla àtte nit ñi jaarale ko ci Yeesu Kirist. Xibaaru jàmm, bi may waare, moo ko wax.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoonu Musaa ak njariñam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Maa ngi ñëw nag ci yaw mi ne Yawut nga; yaa ngi sukkandiku ci yoonu Musaa ak di damu ci Yàlla. <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />Xam nga coobareem, ndaxte jàng nga ci yoonu Musaa, ba fonk yëf yi gëna baax. <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />Yaa ngi teg sa bopp wommatkatu gumba yi ak leeru ñi nekk cig lëndëm. <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />Yaa di jànglekatu ñi jàngul ak xamlekatu ñi xamul, ndaxte xalaat nga ne Yàlla jagleel na leen ci yoonu Musaa bépp xam-xam ak gépp dëgg. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Kon nag yaw miy jàngal say moroom, xanaa doo jàngal sa bopp? Yaw miy waare di tere sàcc, mbaa doo sàcc yaw itam? Yaw miy tere njaaloo, mbaa doo njaaloo? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Yaw miy araamal xërëm yi, mbaa doo sàcc li nekk ci seeni xàmb? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Yaw miy damoo yoonu Musaa, mbaa doo ko moy, ba indi gàcce ci turu Yàlla? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Moo tax Mbind mi ne: «Yéena tax ñi nekkul Yawut di suufeel turu Yàlla.»<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xaraf ak njariñam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Bëggoon naa ngeen xam ne xaraf am na njariñ, boo ca boolee sàmm yoon. Waaye boo ko ca boolewul, sa xaraf amatul njariñ. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Te itam ku xaraful, tey def jëf yu jub yi yoonu Musaa santaane, ndax Yàlla du ko teg ni ku xaraf? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Ku dul Yawut te xaraful waaye di sàmm yoon wi, kooku dina la mana àtte, yaw Yawut bi. Ndaxte li ngay xam xam yoonu Musaa ci Mbind mi te xaraf, terewul nga koy moy. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Juddu nekk Yawut taxul sag Yawut dëggu, te xaraf ci saw yaram taxul sa xaraf wóor. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Waaye Yawut dëgg, ci xol lay nekk. Te xaraf dëgg itam, ci xol lay nekk. Du ngistal, lu dëggu la. Te képp ku mel noonu, dees na la gërëm, waxuma la nit ñi, waaye Yàlla ci boppam.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s">Li Yàlla jagleel Yawut yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Yawut bi nag, ci lan la rawe ku dul Yawut? Te xaraf lu muy njariñ? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Raw na ko fu nekk. Ci bu jëkk Yawut yi la Yàlla dénk waxam. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Bu fekkee ne am na ci ñoom ñu ñàkk kóllëre, ndax loolu man na fanq kóllëreg Yàlla? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Mukk! Su ñépp nekkoon ay naaféq, du tere Yàlla nekk dëgg. Moom la Mbind mi wax ci Yàlla ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">«Loo wax, ñépp ànd ci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">te ku layoo ak yaw, nga yey ko.»<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Su fekkee nag njubadig nit dina feeñal njubteg Yàlla, lu ciy seen xalaat? Wax ji may bëgga wax nag léegi, waxi nit rekk la, maanaam: ndax kon Yàlla àttewul yoon ci li muy daan ku jubadi? <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Mukk! Ndax su Yàlla jubadi woon, naka lay àttee àddina si? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Waaye nag xanaa dina am ku tontu ci loolu ne: «Su fekkee sama ñàkk kóllëre gën na yékkati kóllëreg Yàlla, di yokk it ndamam, lu tax kon Yàlla di ma teg ba tey bàkkaarkat, ba di ma àtte?» <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Lu tax manunoo wax ne: «Nanu def lu bon, ngir lu baax génn ca?» Am na sax ñu nuy tuumaal, di wax ne noonu lanuy waaree. Waaye ñiy wax loolu, ndaan gi ñu yelloo dina leen dal.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku jub amul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Kon nag lu nu ci wara wax? Nun Yawut yi, ndax noo gën ñi ci des? Mukk! Ndaxte wone nanu ne, nit ñépp ñu ngi ci notaangeg bàkkaar, muy Yawut yi mbaa Gereg yi. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Moom la Mbind mi wax ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">«Ku jub amul, du kenn sax.<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Amul kenn ku xam yëfi Yàlla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">mbaa kenn ku koy wut.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Ñépp jeng nañu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">ba kenn amalatul Yàlla njariñ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">Kenn du def lu baax, du kenn sax!<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Seen put a ngi xasaw ni méddum ñetti fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">seen làmmiñ làggi ci njublaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">te seeni kàddu aay ni daŋaru ñàngóor.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Duñu génne ci seen gémmiñ lu dul ay móolu ak i xas.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Ñu sawar lañu ci rey nit.<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Fu ñu jaar, foofa yàqu ak musiba.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Xamuñu yoonu jàmm,<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />te ragal Yàlla sore na seen xol.»<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Xam nanu nag ne lépp lu yoonu Musaa wax, wax na ko ñi nekk ci yoon woowu, ngir gémmiñ yépp ne miig, te waa àddina sépp jaar ci àtteb Yàlla. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Ndaxte sàmm yoon wi taxul kenn jub ci kanam Yàlla; solob ndigal yi daal mooy wone bàkkaar.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bunt bi Yàlla ubbi, ngir musal nit ñi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Waaye léegi nag Yàlla feeñal na, ni nit mana jube ci kanamam, ci lu séqul ak yoonu Musaa dara. Waaye ba tey yoonu Musaa ak waxi yonent yi seedeel nañu ko. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Jub ci kanam Yàlla, gëm Yeesu Kirist rekk a koy maye, te képp ku ko gëm bokk nga ci. Ndaxte ñépp a yem fa kanam Yàlla. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Ñépp a bàkkaar, ba joteetuñu ndamu Yàlla. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Waaye gannaaw Kirist Yeesu dee na ngir jot leen, Yàlla ciw yiwam man na leena àtte ni ñu jub ci dara. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Wàcce na Kirist, mu nekk sarax ngir Yàlla baal nu sunuy bàkkaar, jaar ci deretam ji ñu tuur; te ngëm rekk moo nu ciy boole. Noonu Yàlla firndeel na ne ku jub la, doonte sax dafa muñaloon ñi jiitu jamonoy Kirist, ba jéggal leen seeni bàkkaar. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Kon ci jamono jii nu ne, Yàlla wone na bu leer ne ku jub la, di àtte ni ku jub képp ku gëm Yeesu, te ba tey dëkk ci njubteem.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Kan a mana bàkku nag ci kanam Yàlla? Kenn! Lu ko waral nag? Xanaa sàmm yoon? Déedéet! Ngëm rekk. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Ndaxte danoo dëggal ne ngëm rekk a tax Yàlla di àtte nit ni ku jub, waaye du sàmm yoon. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Walla ndax nag Yawut yi rekk la fi nekkal? Ndax nekkalu fi it ñu dul Yawut? Ahakay! <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Gannaaw Yàlla kenn la, ñépp la fi nekkal. Ñi xaraf dina leen àtte ni ñu jub ndax seen ngëm, ñi xaraful it dina leen àtte ni ñu jub ndax seen ngëm. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Xanaa kon ngëm day fanq yoonu Musaa? Mukk! Da koy gëna dëgëral sax.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Ni Ibraayma gëme Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Sunu maam Ibraayma, mi nu soqikoo; nu mbiram tëdde? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Bu fekkoonte ne Ibraayma, ci kaw i jëfam la ko Yàlla àttee ni ku jub, kon am na lu mu ci mana damoo. Waaye demewul noonu ci kanam Yàlla. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Lan la Mbind mi wax ci loolu? Nee na: «Ibraayma gëm na Yàlla, te Yàlla jàppe ngëmam ni njub.»<verse eid="ROM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Képp kuy liggéey dina jot peyam; te pey googu du ag may, ñaqam la. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Waaye Yàlla dina àtte jub sax ki ko weddi woon; kon ku wéeruwul ciy jëfam, waaye mu gëm rekk, Yàlla dina jàppe ngëmam ni njub. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Noonu la Daawuda birale barkeelug nit ki Yàlla jagleel njub, fekk ay jëfam taxul. <verse eid="ROM 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />Mu ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">«Ñi ñu baal seen jàdd yoon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">te seeni bàkkaar far ci kanam Yàlla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">ñu barkeel lañu.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Ki Boroom bi sëful ay bàkkaaram,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:8">kooka ku barkeel la.»<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Kon nag barkeel googu, ndax ñi xaraf rekk ñoo ko yeyoo? Ndax ñi xaraful it bokkuñu ci? Ahakay! Ndaxte wax nanu ne, Yàlla jàppe na ngëmu Ibraayma ni njub. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Kañ la ko jagleel njub nag? Ndax lu jiitu xarafam la woon, am gannaaw ga? Lu ko jiitu la woon. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ndaxte Ibraayma gëm na, te Yàlla jàppe na ngëmam ni njub, fekk booba xarafagul. Te xarafal gi, màndarga la woon ci yaramam, di firndeel ne ku jub la woon. Noonu la Ibraayma mana nekke baayu ñépp ñi gëm, ba Yàlla man leena àtte ni ñu jub, te xarafuñu sax. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Noonu itam la Ibraayma mana nekke baayu ñi xaraf, bu fekkee yemuñu rekk ci xaraf, waaye ñu am ngëm, ga Ibraayma sunu maam amoon lu jiitu xarafam.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibraayma gëmoon na la ko Yàlla digoon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Ndaxte Yàlla dafa digoon Ibraayma ak ñi naroona soqikoo ci moom, ne dinañu moom àddina si. Te dige boobu jógewul ci yoonu Musaa, waaye dafa jóge ci njub, gi Ibraayma amoon ci kanam Yàlla ci kaw ngëmam. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Ndaxte su fekkee ne ñi nekk ci yoonu Musaa rekk ñooy moom àddina, kon ngëm amatul njariñ, te digeb Yàlla toxu na. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Yoonu Musaa daal du def lu dul wàcce merum Yàlla ci sunu bopp; ndax fu yoon amul, jàdd yoon du fa mana am.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Kon nag loolu Yàlla dige, ngëm rekk a koy indi, ngir mu sukkandikoo yiwu Yàlla rekk. Noonu la dige bi wóore ci ñi soqikoo ci Ibraayma ñépp, du ci ñi nekk ci yoonu Musaa rekk, waaye itam ñi gëm ni Ibraayma gëme woon. Kon Ibraayma mooy sunu baay, nun ñépp. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Moom la Yàlla dogal, wax ko ci Mbind mi ne: «Def naa la baayu xeet yu bare.» Ndaxte Ibraayma gëmoon na Yàlla, miy dekkal ñi dee, tey wax ci lu amagul, mel ni dafa am.<verse eid="ROM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ibraayma dafa jàppoon ci ngëmam, di yaakaar, fekk bunti yaakaar yépp tëju. Moo tax mu nekk baayu xeet yu bare, ni ko Mbind mi waxe ne: «Noonu la sa askan di meli.» <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Mu xool yaramam, xam ne dee rekk a ko dese, ndax mi ngi tollu woon ci lu mat téeméeri at, waaye ba tey ngëmam wàññikuwul. Mu xam it ne, Saarata manatula ëmb. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Waaye loolu taxul ngëmadi jàpp ko, ba muy werante ci waxu Yàlla; ngëmam sax di gëna dëgër, mu daldi sant Yàlla, <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />mu wóor ko ne loolu ko Yàlla dig, Yàlla man na koo def. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Moo tax «Yàlla jagleel na Ibraayma njub.» <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Waaye loolu lañu bind ne: «Yàlla jagleel na ko njub,» du Ibraayma rekk a moom wax ji. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Nun itam ci wax jooju lanu bokk, te Yàlla dina nu jagleel njub, nun ñi gëm Yàlla, mi dekkal Yeesu sunu Boroom. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Ndaxte Yàlla jébbale na ko ngir sunuy tooñ, dekkal ko ngir àtte nu jub.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Jàmm fa kanam Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Léegi nag, gannaaw Yàlla àtte na nu jub ci kaw ngëm, nanu jàpp ci jàmm, ji nu am fa kanam Yàlla, jaarale ko ci sunu Boroom Yeesu Kirist. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Moo nu ubbil bunt ci Yàlla, nu taxaw temm ci yiwam, jaar ci ngëm. Te it nu ngi bég ciy négandiku, Yàlla boole nu ci ndamam. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Te du ci loolu rekk, waaye bég nanu it ci sunuy nattu; ndax xam nanu ne nattu day feddali muñ; <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />te muñ mooy ndeyu jikko ju dëgër; te jikko ju dëgër day jur yaakaar. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Te yaakaar jooju du ay nax, ndax mbëggeelu Yàllaa ngi baawaan ci sunu xol, jaarale ko ci Xelam mu Sell mi mu nu may.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Ndaxte bi nu amul jenn doole, booba la Kirist dee ngir nun, fekk danoo weddi woon Yàlla. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Kuy nangoo deeyal nit ku jub, yombula gis, waaye nag jombul am na ku nangoo deeyal ku baax. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Waaye Yàlla firndeel na mbëggeelam ci nun, ci li Kirist dee ngir nun, bi nu nekkee sax ay bàkkaarkat!<verse eid="ROM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Gannaaw Kirist tuur na deretam nag, ngir Yàlla àtte nu jub, rawatina ne dina nu musal ci merum Yàlla. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Nun ay bañaaley Yàlla lanu woon, waaye Doomam dee na, ngir jubale nu ak moom. Gannaaw léegi nag xariti Yàlla lanu, rawatina ne dinanu mucc ndax dundug Doomam. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Te sax nu ngi bég ci Yàlla, jaarale ko ci sunu Boroom Yeesu Kirist, mi nu jubale ak moom.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dee ndax sunu bokk ci Aadama, <optbreak /> dund ndax sunu bokk ci Kirist</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Kon nag bàkkaar ci kenn nit la jaar, dugg ci àddina, indaale fi dee, te dee daldi law ci nit ñépp, ndaxte ñépp a bàkkaar. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Bàkkaar kon nekkoon na ci àddina, bi Yàlla di laata wàcce yoonu Musaa. Waaye gannaaw yoonu Musaa tëddagul woon, bàkkaar du woon jàdd yoon. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Teewul nag la dale ca Aadama ba ca Musaa, dee a ngi fi woon ci àddina, di not ñépp, ak sax ñi seen bàkkaar melul woon ni bosu Aadama, maanaam jàdd yoon. Aadama moomu nag moo di takkandeeru Kirist, mi waroona ganesi àddina.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Waaye warunoo yemale tooñu Aadama ak mayu Yàlla. Bàkkaaru kenn nit kooku tax na ñu bare dee; waaye yiwu Yàlla ak may, gi nu keneen nit ka Yeesu Kirist yéwénal, baawaan na ci ñu bare, ba suul tooñ googu. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Te bàkkaaru Aadama niroowul ak mayu Yàlla. Aadama bàkkaar na benn yoon, ba tax Yàlla daan ko, daanaale ñépp; waaye Yàlla jéggle na tooñ yu bare ci dara, ba mu àtte ñu bare ni ñu jub. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Bàkkaaru kenn nit tax na dee tàbbi àddina, yilif ñépp ni buur; waaye jëfu keneen nit ka, maanaam Yeesu Kirist, moo ko suul, ba tax ñu bare tàbbi ci dund gu bees, falu ni ay buur; xanaa ñi Yàlla boole ci yiwam wu bare, te àtte leen jub ci dara fa kanamam.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Kon nag nu gàttal wax ji: jàddug kenn nit ka rekk moo waral Yàlla daan ñépp; noonu itam jëf ju jubu keneen nit ka rekk moo ubbi bunt, ba ñépp mana jub ci kanam Yàlla te am dund gu bees. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Aadama moomu dafa déggadil Yàlla, ba yóbbaale ñu bare, ñu nekk i bàkkaarkat; noonu itam Yeesu Kirist dafa déggal Yàlla, yóbbaale ñu bare itam, ñu jub.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Yoonu Musaa daldi wàcc, ngir bàkkaar gëna bare; waaye fa bàkkaar bare, yiwu Yàlla gën faa bare. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Ba tax, ni bàkkaar doon yilife ñépp ni buur, indaale dee, noonu itam la yiwu Yàlla faloo ni buur, jóge ci njub, jëm ci dund gu dul jeex. Loolu lépp darajay Yeesu Kirist sunu Boroom moo nu ko may.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Rëcc nanu ci dooley bàkkaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Lu nu wara wax léegi nag? Xanaa nu sax ci bàkkaar, ngir yiwu Yàlla gëna bare? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Mukk! Nun ñi dee, ba rëcc ci kàttanu bàkkaar, naka lanu manatee sax ci di ko def? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Xanaa dangeena xamul ne, képp ku ñu sóob ci ndox, ngir wone ne mu ngi bokk ci Yeesu Kirist, ci deewu Yeesu la bokk. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Bi ñu nu sóobee ci ndox moomu nag, day misaal ne dañu noo suul ak Kirist, nu dee ni mu deeye woon; ba tax nu dekki it, ni mu dekkee woon ci dooley Yàlla Baay bi, te nu sóobu ci dund gu bees.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Kon nag gannaaw benn lanu ak Kirist, dee ni mu deeye woon, kon dinanu nekk it benn ak moom, dekki ni mu dekkee woon. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Ndegam xam nanu ne daajoon nañu Kirist ca bant ba, xam nanu it ne jikko ju bon ji nu judduwaale, daajaale nañu ko ak Kirist ca bant ba. Yàlla def na loolu, ngir nguuru bàkkaar, gi nekkoon ci sunu yaram tas, nu rëcc ci dooleem. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Ndaxte ku dee, bàkkaar manatul dara ci yaw.<verse eid="ROM 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Gannaaw nag dee nanu ak Kirist, gëm nanu ne dinanu dekki it ni moom, <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />xam ne Kirist mi dekki dootul dee mukk, dee manatul dara ci moom. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Dee na benn yoon, ba bàkkaar manul ci moom dara; mi ngi dund léegi, di ànd ak Yàlla ba fàww.<verse eid="ROM 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Ci noonu nag yéen itam tegleen seen bopp ni ñu dee ak Kirist, ba rëcc ci dooley bàkkaar, di dund, ànd ak Yàlla ba fàww ndax seen bokk ci Yeesu Kirist. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Buleen mayati bàkkaar nag, mu yilif seeni yaram yu néew doole, bay topp ay bëgg-bëggam. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Buleen jébbalati seeni cér bàkkaar, mu def leen jumtukaayam ngir jëfam yu jubadi; waaye gannaaw rëcc ngeen ci dooley dee, bay dundaat, jébbaluleen ci Yàlla te jébbal ko seeni cér, mu def leen jumtukaayam ngir jëfam yu jub. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Ndaxte bàkkaar dootu leen manal dara, yéen ñi génn ci yoonu Musaa, dugg ci yiwu Yàlla.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jaami Yàlla ci yoonu njub</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Lan lanu wara wax nag léegi? Gannaaw génn nanu ci yoonu Musaa, dugg ci yiwu Yàlla, ndax danoo wara sax ci def bàkkaar? Mukk! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Ndax dangeena xamul ne koo jébbalu ci moom te déggal ko, jaamam nga? Naka noonu, mbaa ngeen nekk jaami bàkkaar, mu jëme leen ci dee, mbaa ngeen déggal Yàlla, mu sóob leen ci yoonu njub. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Waaye sant naa Yàlla ci lii: yéen ñi doon jaami bàkkaar, bi ngeen déggee mboolem dëgg gi, nangu ngeen ko ak seen xol bépp. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Ci noonu rëcc ngeen ci notaangeg bàkkaar te jébbalu ci Yàlla, sóobu ci njub.<verse eid="ROM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Xam naa ne seen xam-xam ci mbir mii sorewul, moo tax ma yombal wax ji, awale ko ci baat yii. Ni ngeen jële woon seeni cér, jébbal leen, ñu nekk jaami lu selladi ak lu bon, di gëna jur lu bon, noonu itam léegi jébbal-leen seeni cér, ñu nekk jaami njub, ngeen doora sell. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Ndaxte keroog ba ngeen nekkee jaami bàkkaar, séquleen woon dara ak lu jub. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Ban njariñ ngeen ci jële nag? Dara lu dul gàcce, ndaxte ci dee la leen doon jëmale. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Waaye léegi Yàlla goreel na leen ci kilifteefu bàkkaar, def leen ay jaamam, ba jural leen sellaay, jëme leen ci dund gu dul jeex. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Ndaxte peyu bàkkaar mooy dee, waaye mayu Yàlla mooy dund gu dul jeex ci Yeesu Kirist sunu Boroom.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Bokk ci Kirist dafa mel ni jigéen juy séy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Bokk yi, yéen ñi may waxal xam ngeen luy yoon; xam ngeen kon ne yoon am na doole ci nit diirub dundam. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Ci maanaa, mu ngi mel ni jigéen juy séy; yoon a ngi koy boole ak jëkkëram, ñu ànd seen giiru dund, waaye su jëkkër ji faatoo, buum gi dagg na. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Kon nag su jabar ji àndee ak beneen góor, te fekk jëkkër jiy dund, dees na ko àtte njaaloo. Waaye bu jëkkër ji faatoo, yoon jeexal na seen diggante; man na séy nag ak beneen góor, te du doon njaaloo.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Nii laa leen ko mana misaale, samay bokk; bi Kirist deeyee, dangeena deeyandoo ak moom, te noonu yoonu Musaa wàcc leen. Léegi nag yéena ngi ànd ak keneen, maanaam Kirist mi dekki, ngir nu amal Yàlla njariñ. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Keroog ba nu daan topp sunu nafsu, yoonu Musaa daan na xamb bëgg-bëgg yu bon, yiy yëngal sunuy cér, ba jural nu dee. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Waaye léegi yoon wi wàcc na nu, ci li nu dee, ba rëcc cig buumam. Léegi nag nu ngi jaamu Yàlla, waxuma leen ci sàmm santaane rekk, ndax loolu wees na, waaye ci kàttan gu bees, gi nu Xelum Yàlla di may.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoonu Musaa ak dooley bàkkaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Kon nag lu nu wara wax? Ndax bàkkaar ci yoonu Musaa la jóge? Mukk! Waaye moo ma xamal luy bàkkaar. Ndaxte su ma yoon wi waxul woon: «Bul bëgg yëfi jaambur,» kon duma xam luy xemmem. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Waaye bàkkaar jaare na ci ndigalu Yàlla, daldi ñëw dugg ci man, ba yëngal ci man xemmem yu bare. Ndaxte ba ma xamagul woon yoonu Musaa, bàkkaar da ne woon nemm ci man. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Keroog bi ma xamagul lu yoon wi santaane, maa ngi doon dund dund gu neex; waaye ba ma ko déggee, bàkkaar dafa daldi fuddu ci man, te man ma daldi dee. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Noonu gis naa ne ndigal loolu waroona jëme nit ñi ci dund, daf maa jëme ci dee. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Ndaxte bàkkaar jaar na ci li Yàlla digle, ba nax ma, rey ma.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Kon nag man nanoo wax ne yoonu Musaa yoon wu sell la, te ndigalu Yàlla dafa sell, jub te baax. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Ndax kon lu baax moo ma tàbbal ci dee? Mukk! Bàkkaar a ko def, ngir jikkoom feeñ; dafa gis ci lu baax loolu bunt bu mu mana jaar, ba rey ma. Noonu ndigalu Yàlla tax na, bàkkaar fés, bon ba jéggi dayo.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Li nit bëgga def, manu koo def</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Xam nanu ne yoonu Musaa ngi jóge ci Yàlla, waaye man yëfi àddina laa fonk, te nekk ci dooley bàkkaar, mel nib jaam. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Ndaxte samay jëf jaaxal na ma; li ma bëgga def, duma ko def, waaye li ma bañ rekk, moom laay def. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Kon nag gannaaw li may def du sama coobare, nangu naa ne yoonu Musaa baax na. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Léegi nag du man maay def lu bon loolu, waaye bàkkaar bi dëkk ci man, moo ma ciy jiiñ. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Ndaxte xam naa ne lu baax dëkkul ci man, maanaam ci sama bindu doom Aadama. Am naa yéeney def lu baax, waaye awma kàttanu yeggale. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Lu baax nag lu may yéene, duma ko def, waaye lu bon lu ma bëggul, moom laay def. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Bu fekkee nag lu ma bëggul, moom laay def, kon dootul sama coobare, waaye bàkkaar bi dëkk ci man, moo ma ci jiiñ.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Gis naa nag lii: saa su ma bëggee def lu baax, lu bon a ngi ma taxawu. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Ndaxte ci sama biir xol yoonu Yàlla wi neex na ma. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Waaye gis naa jeneen doole juy yëngu ci samay céri yaram, di bëre ak li sama xol bëgg; day bëre ba not ma, def ma jaam ci dooley bàkkaar joojuy yëngu ci samay cér. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Céy maaka torox! Ana ku may musal ci sama yaram, wii may jëme ci dee? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Maa ngi sant Yàlla; am na kuy musle, mooy Yeesu Kirist sunu Boroom.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Kon nag lii laa gis ci sama bopp: ci sama xel maa ngi topp yoonu Yàlla, waaye ci sama bindu doom Aadama maa ngi topp yoonu bàkkaar.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Dund gu bees ci dooley Xelu Yàlla mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Léegi nag yoon manula dab ñi bokk ci Yeesu Kirist. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Ndaxte kàttanu Xelum Yàlla, tukkee ci Kirist Yeesu, di may nit dund gu bees, goreel na ma ci notaangeg bàkkaar ak dee. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Lu yoonu Musaa manul woona def, ndax néew dooley nit, Yàlla defe na ko nii: dafa yónni Doomam, ngir mu yor sunu jëmm, nun ñiy nekk ay bàkkaarkat, ba noppi mu jébbale bakkanam, ngir dindi bàkkaar yi. Noonu la Yàlla tase nguuru bàkkaar ci nit. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Ba tax na léegi njub, gi yoonu Musaa di digle, am na ci nun, ñiy déggal Xelu Yàlla mi te baña topp sunu nafsu.<verse eid="ROM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Ñiy topp seen nafsu, seeni bëgg-bëgg rekk lañu fonk, waaye ñiy topp Xelu Yàlla mi, coobareem lañu fonk. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Ndaxte fonk nafsu, ci dee lay jëme; waaye fonk Xelu Yàlla mi, dund ak jàmm lay joxe. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Ndaxte ku fonk sa nafsu, bañaaleb Yàlla nga, ndaxte doo déggal Yàlla, mbaa ngay sàmm ay santaaneem, te manuloo koo def sax. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Kuy topp sa nafsu nag, doo mana neex Yàlla.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Waaye yéen nekkatuleen ci topp seen nafsu, waaye yéena ngi topp Xelu Yàlla mi, bu fekkee ne mu ngi dëkk ci yéen. Ku amul Xelum Kirist nag, bokkuloo ci moom. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Bu fekkee ne Kirist dëkk na ci yéen nag, lii moo am: seen yaram mi ngi ci dooley dee ndax bàkkaar bi nekk ci yéen, waaye seen xel mi ngi dund ndax njub gi leen Yàlla jox. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Kon nag gannaaw Xelum Yàlla, mi dekkal Yeesu ca néew ya, dëkk na ci yéen, dina tax seen yaram wi néew doole dund ci kàttanu Xel moomu dëkk ci yéen.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Kon nag bokk yi, am nanu lu nu war, waaye waxuma leen topp sunu nafsu ak i bëgg-bëggam; <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />ndaxte kuy topp nafsoom, fàww mu dee, waaye kuy not jëfi yaramam ci dooley Xelu Yàlla mi, dina dund. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Ndaxte ñépp ñiy déggal Xelu Yàlla mi, ay doomi Yàlla lañu. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Nekkatuleen fa kanam Yàlla, ni jaam bu ragal sangam, waaye Xel mi leen Yàlla sol, ay doomi Yàlla la leen def, ba tax nu di wooye Yàlla: «Abba», maanaam «Baay.» <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Ndaxte Xelu Yàlla mi, moom ci boppam, day ànd ak sunu xel ci seede ne doomi Yàlla lanu. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Gannaaw ay doomi Yàlla lanu, dinanu moomi lépp li Yàlla jagleel ay doomam, séddu ci ngëneel yi Kirist yelloo. Waaye nag ku bëgga bokk ak Kirist ndamam ëllëg, war ngaa séddu ci ay fitnaam tey.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndam liy ñëw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Xalaat naa ne sunu naqaru tey, wareesu ko tëkkale ak sunu ndamu ëllëg. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Ndax li Yàlla bind lépp a ngi ne seewa gis doomi Yàlla yi feeñ ci seen biir ndam. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Ndaxte dunyaa bi bépp mu ngi ci yoon wu dul mujj fenn; teyu ko, Yàlla moo ko ko teg. Waaye teewul ñu am yaakaar ne, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Yàlla dina rengi seen buumi njaam ci dee, boole leen ci jàmmu doomi Yàlla yi ak seen ndam.<verse eid="ROM 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Xam nanu ba fi nu tollu ne li Yàlla bind lépp a ngi mititlu ni jigéen juy matu. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Te du dunyaa bi rekk mooy mititlu, nun it nu ngi mititlu, nun ñi Yàlla sol Xelam, ngir nu ñam añu ëllëg; nu ngi ne seew Yàlla boole nu ci lépp li nu yelloo ni ay doomam, keroog bés bu Yàllay goreel sunu yaram. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Ndaxte sunu mucc ëmb na yaakaar. Li nga gis ba noppi, nekkatul yaakaar; li teew, noo koy yaakaare? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Li feek gisagunu nag li nuy yaakaar, dinanu ko séentu ak muñ.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Te it Xelu Yàlla mi moo nuy xettali ci sunug néew doole. Ndaxte xamunu sax naka lanu wara ñaane Yàlla, waaye Xelu Yàlla maa ngi nuy ñaanal fa moom ak i yéene yu làmmiñ manta takk. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Te Yàlla, miy nattu xol yi, xam na xalaatu Xel mi, ndaxte tinu, gi muy tinul gaayi Yàlla yi, méngoo na ak coobarey Yàlla.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Xam nanu itam ne ñi bëgg Yàlla, maanaam ñi Yàlla woo ci boppam te boole leen ci li mu tëral, Yàlla dina joo loxoom ci lépp lu xew ci seen dund, ngir jural leen lu baax. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Ndaxte ñi mu xamoon lu jiitu, dafa dogaloon ñu nirook Doomam, ngir mu nekk taaw ci biir njaboot gu yaa. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Ñi mu dogaloon loolu ci ñoom, da leena woo; ñooñu mu woo, da leena àtte ni ñu jub; ñooñu mu àtte jub, da leena boole ca ndamam.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbëggeelu Yàlla ci Yeesu Kirist</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Lu nu wara wax nag ci loolu lépp? Gannaaw Yàlla ànd na ak nun, kan moo nu manal dara? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Yàlla mi nu gàntulul Doomam waaye mu joxe ko, mu dee ngir nun, ndax dina nu bañalati dara? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Ñi Yàlla tànnal boppam, kan moo leen di tuumaal? Yàlla moo leen àtte ni ñu jub. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Kan moo leen mana teg tooñ? Yeesu Kirist mi dee, moo dekki itam, te mu nga fa ndijoorul Yàlla, di nu fa ñaanal! <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Kan moo nu mana tàggaleek mbëggeelu Kirist? Xanaa duy nattu, te du njàqare, du it fitna, du xiif walla rafle, du it ay ngaañ walla jaasi sax. <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Moo tax Mbind mi ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">«Ñu ngi nuy rey ngir yaw, ci suba ba jant so;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">ñu ngi nuy jàppe ni xar yu ñuy rey.»<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Waaye loolu lépp teewul, nu ngi mel niy ñeyi xare ci dooley Kirist mi nu bëgg. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Ndax wóor na ma ne dara manu noo tàggaleek mbëggeelam; du dee, du dund, du malaaka yi, du seeni kilifa, du tey, du ëllëg, du boroom doole yi, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />du li ci kaw mbaa li ci suuf, mbaa leneen lu ñu bind; dara manu noo tàggale mukk ak mbëggeel, gi nu Yàlla jox ci Kirist Yeesu sunu Boroom.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Yàlla tànnal na boppam bànni Israyil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Li ma bëgga wax nag, ci kanam Kirist laa koy waxe; dëgg la, du aw fen. Sama xel, mi Xel mu Sell miy leeral, seedeel na ma ne dëgg laay wax. <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Maanaam, duma noppee am naqar wu réy ci sama biir xol, <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />ba xawa bëgga tàggoo ak Kirist te alku, ngir ñi ma bokkal xeet mucc. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Bànni Israyil lañu, te Yàlla def na leen ni ay doomam; dëkkaloon na ndamam ci seen biir, fas ak ñoom kóllëre yi. Ñoom la Yàlla dénk yoonu Musaa, ñoom la xamal ni ñu ko wara jaamoo, ñoom la jox i digam. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Maam ya Yàlla tànnoon, ci ñoom lañu bokk, ci ñoom it la Kirist wàcce, maanaam ci jëmmam, Kirist mi di Yàlla, tiim lépp, te yelloo teraanga ba fàww. Amiin.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Waaye neewuma waxu Yàlla dafa toxu, ndaxte bokk ci bànni Israyil, taxul nga bokk ci Israyil tigi. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Te it du ñi soqikoo ci Ibraayma ñépp, ay doomam dëgg lañu. Ndaxte Yàlla dafa wax Ibraayma ne ko: «Saw askan ci Isaaxa lay jaar.» <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Maanaam, soqikoo ci Ibraayma taxula nekk doomu Yàlla, waaye juddu ci biir digeb Yàlla mooy taxa bokk dëgg-dëgg ci askanu Ibraayma. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Ndaxte Yàlla dafa digoon Ibraayma ne ko: «Ci waxtu wii déwén dinaa délsi ci yaw, te Saarata dina am doom ju góor.»<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Du ci loolu rekk, waaye noonu la it ci lu jëm ci Rebeka; doom yi mu jur ñoo bokk benn baay, moo di sunu maam Isaaxa. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11-12" />Waaye Yàlla wax ko ne: «Yanqóoba rakk ji mooy yilif magam Esawu,» fekk xale ya juddooguñu te defaguñu dara, muy lu baax, muy lu bon. Yàlla def na noonu, maanaam tànn kenn ci doom yi, ngir dogalam mana taxaw, te sukkandikuwul ci seeni jëf waaye ci wooteb Yàlla. <verse eid="ROM 9:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Loolu la Mbind mi wax ne: «Bëgg naa Yanqóoba, bañ naa Esawu.»<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Kon lu nu ci wara wax? Ndax Yàlla àttewul foofu yoon nag? Mukk! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Dafa wax Musaa sax ne ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:15">«Su ma neexee yéwéne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:15">su ma soobee yërëm.»<verse eid="ROM 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Dama leen di wax nag, dara ajuwul ci coobarey nit, mbaa ci ñaqam, waaye lépp a ngi aju ci yërmandey Yàlla. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Ndax Mbind mi biral na li Yàlla wax Firawna ne ko: «Def naa la buur, ngir feeñal sama kàttan ci say mbir, ngir siiwal sama tur ci àddina si sépp.» <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Kon nag Yàlla, la ko neex lay def, muy yërëm nit, mbaa dëgëral xolam ci lu bon.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Merum Yàlla ak yërmandeem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Waaye xanaa dina am ku may wax ne: «Gannaaw kenn manula bañ coobarey Yàlla, lu tax kon muy teg nit tooñ?» <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Yaw nag nit ki, ak koo mana doon, lu tax ngay werante ak Yàlla? Ndax mbindeef dina laaj ki ko bind: «Lu tax nga binde ma nii?» <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Ndax tabaxkatu ndaa sañula fab banam, tabax ci ñaari ndaa, benn bi ngir soxla yu am maana, bi ci des ngir soxla yu ndaw?<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Kon nag looy wax ci lii: Yàlla bëggoon na wone meram, xamle it dooleem ci àddina; teewul dafa sax ci muñal ñi yelloo meram te taxaw ci sànku. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Bëggoon na it xamle màggaayam mu ëpp xel, ci boole ñi mu yërëm ci ndamam; moo tax mu tànn leen ca njàlbéen. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Wax ji noo ko moom, nun ñi Yàlla woo ci boppam ci biir Yawut yi ak ci biir xeet yi ci des. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Moom la wax ci téereb Ose ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">«Ñi nekkul woon sama xeet</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">dinaa leen ko def,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">ñi bokkul woon ci sama mbëggeel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">dinaa leen ci boole.»<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Te:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">«Fa ñu leen waxe woon: “Dungeen sama xeet,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">dees na leen fa wooye “Doomi Yàlla Boroom dund.”»<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Esayi wax na ci mbirum Israyil ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">«Lu bànni Israyil baree bare ni suufus géej sax,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">lu néew rekk a ciy mucc.<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Ndaxte li Boroom bi dogal ci àddina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:28">dina ko gaawa def, te dina mat sëkk.»<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Esayi it waxoon na lu jiitu loolu ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">«Boroom gàngoori xare yi, su bàyyiwul woon ci nun lu néew,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">kon ba tey raat nanu ni dëkki Sodom ak Gomor.»<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bànni Israyil ak xibaaru jàmm bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Lu nu ci wara wax nag? Ñi dul Yawut te fonkuñu woon jub ci kanam Yàlla, léegi jub nañu ci kaw ngëm. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Waaye bànni Israyil, mi bëggoona sàmm yoon ngir jub, matalu ko. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Ndax lan? Ndax dañoo sukkandiku ci seeni jëf, bàyyi ngëm. Dañoo daanu ci «doj wuy fakktale.» <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Moom la Yàlla wax ci Mbind mi ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">«Dinaa samp ci Siyoŋ doj wuy fakktale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">di xeer wuy daaneel nit;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">waaye ku wéeru ci moom, sa yaakaar du tas.»<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Bokk yi, sama coobarey xol ci bànni Israyil ak sama ñaan ci Yàlla, mooy ñu mucc. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Seedeel naa leen ne, ñu farlu lañu ci jaamu Yàlla, waaye seen njaamu àndul ak xam-xam. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Xamuñu yoon, wi Yàlla tëral ngir nit jub ci kanamam, waaye dañoo wéy ci seen pexey bopp; ba tax ñu baña nangu yoonu njub woowu Yàlla tëral. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Ndaxte ci Kirist la yoonu Musaa dëppe, ba tax ku ko gëm, dinga jub fa kanam Yàlla.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yàlla bëggoon na ñépp mucc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Ku bëgga jub ci kanam Yàlla ci kaw sàmm yoon, Musaa daf cee wax ne: «Ku ko manoona matal, dinga dund ba fàww.» <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Waaye ku jub ci kanam Yàlla ci kaw ngëm, nii lay waxe:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:6">«Bul wax ci sa xol ne: “Kuy yéeg ci kaw?”»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 10:6">mel ni dangaa bëgg Kirist wàcc.<verse eid="ROM 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />«Bul wax it: “Kuy dem ca barsàq?”»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 10:7">mel ni dangaa bëgg Kirist dekki. <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Kon boog lan lay wax? Lii:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:8">«Waxu Yàlla mi ngi ci sa wet, ci sa làmmiñ, ci sa xol.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 10:8">Te wax jooju lal ngëm lanuy waare. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Ndaxte soo waxee ak sa gémmiñ ne, Yeesu mooy Boroom bi, te nga gëm ci sa xol ne, Yàlla dekkal na ko, dinga mucc. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Ndax xol la nit di gëme, ba tax mu jub ci kanam Yàlla; làmmiñ it la nit di waxe ne mi ngi ci Kirist, ba tax Yàlla musal ko. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Mbind mi dafa wax ne: «Képp ku ko gëm, sa yaakaar du tas mukk.» <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Ndax ñépp a yem ci kanam Yàlla, muy Yawut mbaa ku dul Yawut, ndax kenn rekk mooy sunu Boroom nun ñépp; ku yéwén la ci képp ku koy ñaan. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Ndaxte bind nañu: «Képp ku woo Boroom bi ciw turam, dinga mucc.»<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Waaye nan lañuy wooye ki ñu gëmagul? Naka lañu mana gëme ki ñu déggagul turam? Naka lañu mana dégge turam, te kenn xamalu leen ko? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Nan lañu mana waaree, su leen kenn yónniwul? Looloo tax Mbind mi wax ne: «Ñiy yégle xibaaru jàmm bi, ni seen ñëw di sedde xol!»<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Waaye ñépp nanguwuñu xibaaru jàmm bi; moom la Esayi wax ne: «Boroom bi, ana ku gëm sunu waare?» <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Kon boog ngëm ci kaw dégg lay juddoo, te dégg sosoo ci xibaaru Kirist.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Waaye ma ne: xanaa ñépp dañoo déggul? Ahakay! Mbind mi wax na ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">«Seen baat jolli na ci ñeenti xébla yépp,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">seen wax wër na àddina sépp.»<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Waaye ma teg ci ne: xanaa bànni Israyil dañoo xamul? Ahakay! Musaa dafa jëkkoona wax ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">«Dinaa leen siisloo xeet wu bokkul ci Yàlla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">merloo leen ci ñi xamul dara ci Yàlla.»<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Esayi it takk na fitam, ba wax ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">«Ñi ma wutul woon, gis nañu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">feeñ naa ci ñi ma laajul woon.»<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Waaye ci mbirum Israyil dafa wax ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:21">«Tàllal naa samay loxo, suba ba ngoon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:21">ci xeet wu may bañ tey werante.»<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Yàlla bërgëlul bànni Israyil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Ma ne kon, ndax Yàlla bërgël na xeetam? Mukk! Ndaxte man itam ci Israyil laa bokk, wàcce ci Ibraayma te bokk ci giiru Beñamin. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Yàlla bërgëlul xeetam, wi mu xamoon lu jiitu. Ndax dangeena xamul li Mbind mi di wax ci mbirum Ilyaas? Dafa doon tawat Israyil ci Yàlla naan: <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />«Boroom bi, rey nañu say yonent, daaneel say bérab yu sell, ba man kenn maa ci des, te ñu ngi may wuta rey.» <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Waaye Yàlla da ko ne: «Dencal naa sama bopp juróom ñaari junniy nit ñu jaamuwul Baal.» <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Noonu itam ci jamono ji nu nekk, des na nit ñu néew ñu Yàlla dencal boppam ciw yiwam. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Gannaaw nag yiwu Yàlla rekk a tax mu denc leen, kon du seen peyug ñaq, walla boog yiwu Yàlla dootul yiw.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Kon lu nu ci wara wax? Li bànni Israyil doon wut, gisuñu ko. Waaye ñi Yàlla tànn rekk a ko gis, te ña ca des baña gëm, ba seen xol dërkiis. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Looloo tax Mbind mi ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">«Yàlla daf leena jox xelum nit ku gëmméentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">bët yu gëlëm ak nopp yu tëx,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">ba ci bésub tey.»<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Te Daawuda it daf ci wax naan:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">«Na seeni ñam sax nekk fiir ak i pakk;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">nañu ci daanu, te Yàlla mbugal leen.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Nañu gumba ba ne fatuus,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">nañu tiis te sëgg ba fàww.»<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Ndax kon dañoo tarxiis, daanu ba fàww? Mukk! Waaye jéllub Israyil dafa ubbi bunt, ngir xeeti ñi dul Yawut mana mucc, te bànni Israyil siis leen. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Gannaaw seen tooñ nag moo ubbi buntu yiw ci waa àddina si, te seen ñàkk moo meññ barkeb xeet yépp, céy bés bu Israyil gépp delloo ci Yàlla, ndaw barke bu bare!<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muccu ñi dul Yawut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Yéen ñi dul Yawut, yéen laay waxal. Ndegam Yàlla daf maa def ndawam, yónni ma ci yéen xeeti àddina si, damay matal samab yónnent. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Dama koy def, ngir ñi bokk ak man xeet siis, ba ñenn ñi mucc. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Ndaxte bi Yàlla génnee Israyil, ubbee na noonu bunt, ngir xeeti àddina juboo ak moom; kon su Yàlla dugalaatee Israyil, ndax du mel ni ndekkitel néew ya? <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Damay wax ne, mburu mépp sell na, bu ci Yàlla amee wàll. Naka noonu garab gi Yàlla séddoo reen bi, garab gépp sell na.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Bànni Israyil a ngi mel ni garabu oliw gu ñu jëmbët ci kër gi, waaye mu am car yu ci fàq. Yaw mi dul Yawut, yaa ngi mel ni caru garabu oliw gu àll bu ñu jabtal ci garabu kër googu. Noonu nga jariñoo meen, mi jóge ci reen bi. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Kon nag bul bàkku, di xeeb car yooyu Yàlla fàq. Waaye soo bëggee bàkku, xamal ne reen moo lay yenu, te du yaw miy car yaa koy yenu.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Xanaa dinga wax ne: «Car yooyu dañu leena fàq, ngir jabtal ma fa ñu nekkoon.» <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Dëgg la; waaye seen ngëmadee tax ñu fàq leen, wuutal la fa ndax sa ngëm. Bumu tax nag ngay bàkku, waaye nanga moytu. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Gannaaw Yàlla baalul car ya cosaanoo ca garab ga, kon boog yéen itam man na leena fàq.<verse eid="ROM 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Loolu kon wone na ni Yàlla baaxe ak ni muy meree tooñ. Ci ñi daanu, Yàlla wone na ni meram tànge, wone mbaaxam ci yéen, su fekkee yéena ngi ci wéy; lu ko moy, dees na leen fàq yéen itam. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Te car yooyu fàq, su ñu wéyul ci seen ngëmadi, dees na leen delloo ci garab gi, ndax Yàlla man na leen cee tafaat. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Yaw mi dul Yawut, yaa ngi bokkoon ci garabu oliw gu àll, waaye Yàlla daf la cee jële, ci lu dul farala am, jabtal la ci garabu kër gi. Kon man nanoo gëna wóor ne, Yawut ya judduwaale nekk ci garabu oliw gu kër gi, Yàlla dina leen ci delloo.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yàlla bëgg na yërëm ñépp</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Bokk yi, dama leena bëgga dindi kumpa ci lii, ngir ngeen baña yég seen bopp. Dërkiisu xol dab na bànni Israyil ab diir, ba bés ba mboolem waa àddina, ñu wara bokk ci nguuru Yàlla, dugg ca. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Bu loolu amee nag, bànni Israyil gépp dina mucc. Moom la Mbind mi tëral, bi mu naan:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">«Ab xettalikat dina jóge ci Siyoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">dàq weddi ci askanu Yanqóoba.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Loolu mooy kóllëre, gi may fas ak ñoom,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">bés bu may dindi seeni bàkkaar.»<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Gannaaw bañ nañu xibaaru jàmm bi, ay bañaaley Yàlla lañu, ngir ngeen jot barkeem. Waaye gannaaw Yàlla tànn na leen, dafa leen bëgg ba tey ndax seen maam ya. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Ndax li Yàlla maye, dootu ko nangu mukk, te ku mu woo ci boppam, dootu la dàq mukk. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Ñu déggadil Yàlla ngeen woon, waaye ngëmadig Yawut yi tax na, ngeen jot yërmandeem. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Ñoom itam lànk nañu léegi, ngir mana bokk ak yéen yërmandey Yàlla. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Kon Yàlla tëj na ñépp ci ngëmadi, ngir mana yërëm ñépp.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yàlla yelloo na teraanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Xelum Yàlla ni mu xóote, ak xam-xamam ni mu baree, ba raw xelum nit! Kan moo muus, ba xam dogalam? Walla nga am xel, ba nànd ay jëfam? <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Mbind mi dafa ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">«Ana ku xam xalaatu Boroom bi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">Ku ko doon digal?»<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Te it:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:35">«Ku ko masa jox dara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:35">ba mu war laa delloo?»<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Ndaxte ci moom la lépp sosoo, ci moom la lépp di jaar, ci moom la lépp di dellu. Moo yelloo ndam ba fàww! Amiin.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Jaamu Yàlla ci dund gu bees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Kon nag bokk yi, gannaaw yërmandey Yàlla baree na noonu, maa ngi leen di ñaan, ngeen jébbal ko seen yaram wépp. Na seen dund mel ni sarax su ñuy defal Yàlla, sarax su sell te neex ko. Loolu mooy njaamu, gi leen war. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Bu leen àddina jay, waaye yeesluleen ci seen xel, ba soppiku, ngeen mana xam bu wér coobarey Yàlla, di lépp lu baax, neex ko te mat sëkk.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Gannaaw Yàlla may na ma ciw yiwam, ma nekk ndawam, maa ngi leen di wax lii, kenn ku nekk ci yéen: buleen yég seen bopp, waaye ngeen am xalaat yu yem, méngook ngëm gi leen Yàlla sédd, ku nekk ak wàllam. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Loolu, ci maanaa, mi ngi mel ni yaramu nit: yaram, lu cér yi baree bare, benn niroowul ak moroomam liggéey. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Noonu itam nun ñi bokk ci Kirist, lu nu baree bare, benn lanu te danoo mànkoo. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Kon gannaaw Yàlla séddale na ay mayam, ku nekk ak sa cér, nanu koy jëfandikoo. Ku Yàlla may, ngay waare kàddoom, nga wax ko kem sa ngëm; <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />kuy topptoo yëfi mbooloo mi, nga takku ci; ku Yàlla may, ngay jàngle, nekk ci; <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />kuy feddali ngëmu nit ñi ci Yàlla, nga sax ci; kuy séddoo alalam ak nit ñi, nga def ko ak xol bu laab; kuy jiite mbooloo mi, nga sawar ci; kuy dimbali ñi néew doole, nanga ci bég.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Na seen cofeel di lu dëggu te baña nekk ngistal; araamal-leen lu bon te sax ci lu baax. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Bëgganteleen ak xol bu leer, niy doomi ndey, te farlu ci teralante. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Sawarleen te baña tayel, di jaamu Boroom bi ak seen xol bépp. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Bégleen ci yaakaaru ëllëg te muñ bépp tiis, di sax ci ñaan Yàlla. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Dimbalileen gaayi Yàlla yi ci seeni soxla, te saxoo dalal gan.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Ku leen fitnaal, ñaanal-leen ko yiw, te bañ koo móolu. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Bégandooleen ak ñi bég, te jooyandoo ak ñiy jooy. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Bokkleen menn xel, tey baña yékkatiku, di yóotu daraja, waaye ngeen fonk ñi suufe; buleen teg seen bopp boroomi xel.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Buleen feyante lu bon, waaye sàkkuleen seede su rafet ci kanam ñépp. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Wutleena juboo ak ñépp, ba fa seen kàttan yem. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Samay soppe, buleen di feyantoo, waaye bàyyileen lépp ci loxoy Yàlla, mi yelloo àtte; ndax Yàlla nee na ci Mbind mi: «Man maay àtte, maay fey jëf.» <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Waaye defleen lii:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">«Bu sa noon xiifee, may ko mu lekk;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">bu maree, may ko mu naan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">Ndax boo ko defee, dinga ko rusloo.»<verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Bu leen lu bon ëpp doole, waaye notleen ko ci def lu baax.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Ñépp war nañoo déggal njiit yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Gannaaw loolu na nit ku nekk déggal ñi yore baat ci kanamam; ndaxte amul njiit lu fi Yàlla sampul. Njiit yépp nag Yàlla moo leen fi teg. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Kon ku leen baña déggal, ndigalu Yàlla nga lànk; ku def loolu, yoon dina la dab. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Kuy def lu baax warula ragal njiit li, kuy def lu bon moo ko wara ragal. Soo ko bëggee baña ragal nag, kon defal lu baax, te dina la tagg. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Ndax Yàllaa ko dénk liggéey boobu ngir sa jàmm. Waaye sooy def lu bon, war ngaa ragal, ndax du cig neen la ame jaasiy àtte; jawriñu Yàlla la ngir wàcce meru Yàlla, ci fey ku def lu bon. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Kon fokk ngeen déggal ko, waxuma sax ndax sañ-sañam boobu, waaye it ngir seen xel dal.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Gannaaw Yàllaa sas njiit yi liggéey boobu, te ñi ngi ci, kon fàww ngeen fey galag. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Joxleen ku nekk céram; ku ngeen wara fey galag, feyleen ko ko; ku ngeen wara fey juuti, feyleen ko ko; ku ngeen wara weg, wegleen ko; ku ngeen wara teral, teral-leen ko.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bëgganteleen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Buleen ameel kenn dara, lu dul mbëggeel; ndax ku bëgg sa moroom, wàccoo nga ak yoonu Musaa. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Ndaxte ndigali Yàlla yépp, yi deme ni: «Bul njaaloo, bul bóome, bul sàcc, bul bëgge,» walla leneen ndigal lu mu mana doon, wax jii moo leen ëmb: «Nanga bëgg sa moroom, ni nga bëgge sa bopp.» <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Ku bëgg sa moroom, doo ko tooñ; kon ku wéy ci mbëggeel matal nga yoonu Musaa.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jekkleen ngir teeru Kirist, buy délsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Te lii itam am na: xam ngeen bu baax jamono ji nu tollu; jamonoy yewwu jot na, ndax léegi sunu mucc gën na noo jege, ca ba nu dooree gëm. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Guddi gi màggat na, bët a ngi bëgga set. Nanu bàyyi nag jëf yu lëndëm te ràngoo gànnaay yi nu Yàlla jox, ngir dund ci leer. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Gannaaw nu ngi ci leer, na sunug dund rafet. Bunu naan sàngara ba màndi tey bànneexu; bunu njaaloo tey def i ñaawteef ak sunuy cér; bunu xuloo mbaa nuy ñeeyante. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Waaye gànnaayooleen Yeesu Kirist Boroom bi, te baña topp seen bakkan ciy bëgg-bëggam yu bon.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Baña teg sa moroom tooñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Gannaaw loolu ku ngëmam néew nangeen ko nangu, te baña werante ak moom ci lu lënt. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Ndax am na ku xalaat ne man na lekk ñam wu nekk, fekk ku ngëmam néew du lekk yàpp, waaye léjum rekk lay lekk. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Kiy lekk lu nekk, bumu xeeb ki ko dul def. Naka noonu itam ku dul lekk yàpp, bumu teg tooñ ki koy lekk; ndax Yàlla nangu na leen ñoom ñaar. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Koo teg sa bopp, ba di ko teg tooñ? Jaamu jaambur la! Mu taxaw ci liggéeyam, mbaa mu sàggane ko, moom ak sangam la. Waaye dina jub, ndax Boroom bi am na dooley taxawal ko ci njub.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Noonu itam am na ñiy tànn bés ak ñiy yemale bés yépp. Na ku nekk xam bu wér li muy def, te jàpp ci. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Ndaxte kuy tànn bés, mu ngi koy def ngir màggal Boroom bi. Kiy lekk lu nekk it, mu ngi koy def ngir màggal Boroom bi; loolu leer na ndax day sant Yàlla. Te it ki baña lekk yàpp, mu ngi koy def ngir màggal Boroom bi, di ko sant. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Kenn ci nun dundul ngir boppam, kenn deewul it ngir boppam. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Danuy dund ngir màggal Boroom bi, dee it ngir màggal ko. Kon nag nuy dund mbaa nu dee, noo ngi ci Boroom bi.<verse eid="ROM 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Loolu sax moo waral Kirist dee te dundaat, ngir mana nekk Boroomu ñi dee ak ñiy dund. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Yaw nag lu tax ngay teg sa moroom tooñ? Lu tax nga koy xeeb? Xanaa nun ñépp, danu dul dajeji fa kanam Yàlla, ngir mu layoo ak nun? <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Ndaxte Mbind mi tëral na lii:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">«Boroom bi nee na:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">“Ni mu wóore ne maa ngi dund,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">ni la wóore ne, ñépp dinañu ma sukkal,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">te ku nekk seede ne maay Yàlla.”»<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Noonu ku nekk ci nun dinga làyyi fa Yàlla ci lépp loo masa def.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baña yóbbe sa moroom bàkkaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Kon nanu bàyyee tegante tooñ, waaye nu fas yéenee moytu lépp lu nekk fiir guy yóbbe sunu moroom bàkkaar. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Xam naa ne amul wenn ñam wu sellul, ndax Yeesu Boroom bi xamal na ma loolu. Waaye loo yaakaar ne sellul, ci yaw la sellul. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Soo dee lekk luy indil sa moroom tiis, génn nga ci mbëggeel. Yaw nag bul réeral sa moroom ci sa ñam, ndax Kirist dee na ngir moom. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Bu sa njariñ jur wax ju ñaaw. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Ndaxte bokk ci nguuru Yàlla jotewul dara ak lu nuy lekk mbaa lu nuy naan. Nguuru Yàlla mooy jub ci kanam Yàlla te am mbég ak jàmm ci dooley Xel mu Sell mi. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Kiy jaamoo noonu Kirist moo neex Yàlla ak nit ñi.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Kon nag nanu wut luy indi jàmm, tey yékkati ngëmu sunu moroom. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Bu sa ñam yàq jëfu Yàlla. Bépp ñam sell na ci kanam Yàlla. Ci lu wér! Waaye képp ku lekk luy yàq sa ngëmu moroom, def nga lu bon. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Liy sa warugar mooy nga baña fiir sa moroom ci yàpp mbaa ci biiñ mbaa ci leneen lu mu mana doon.<verse eid="ROM 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Su fekkee sa ngëm dëgër na, wone ko ci sa diggante ak Yàlla. Kiy nangu, te du ci sikkal boppam, kooku barkeel na. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Waaye kuy lekk ñam te am ci xel ñaar, def nga bàkkaar, ndax sa ngëm yemu fa. Ndaxte jëf ju àndul ak ngëm, bàkkaar la.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Wut li neex sa moroom, te baña topp sa bànneex</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Nun ñi dëgër ci sunu ngëm, war nanoo nangu ñi seen ngëm néew te am ci lu ñuy sikki-sàkka, te baña yem ci wut sunu bànneex. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Na ku nekk ci nun di wut lu neex moroomam ngir jariñ ko, ba mu gëna dëgër ci ngëmam. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Ndaxte Kirist masula wut bànneexu boppam. Loolu la Mbind mi wax ne: «Lor yi ñu la saagaa, ci sama kaw lañu dal.» <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Ndaxte lépp lu ñu waxoon ci Mbind mi lu jiitu tey, dañu koo tëraloon, ngir nu sàkku ci xam-xam, xam-xam bu nuy may fit ak muñ, ak di feddali sunu yaakaar. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Kon nag Yàlla miy maye muñ ak fit, na leen may, ngeen déggoo te nekk benn bu yellook li Kirist Yeesu wone. <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />Ba tax nu bokk benn xalaat ak benn baat ci màggal Yàlla, Baayu Yeesu Kirist sunu Boroom.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xibaaru jàmm bi, ñépp la ñëwal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Moo tax nangoonteleen, bay màggal Yàlla, ni leen Kirist nangoo. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Lii laay wax: Kirist ñëw na liggéeyal Yawut yi, ngir wone kóllëreg Yàlla ci matal dige, ya mu digoon maam ya. <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />Ñëw na itam ngir ñi nekkul Yawut mana màggal Yàlla ndax yërmandeem. Moo tax Mbind mi ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">«Dinaa la màggal tey tagg saw tur</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">ci kanam xeet yépp.»<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Mbind mi nee na it:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">«Yéen xeeti àddina, ñëwleen bànneexu ak xeet wi Yàlla tànnal boppam.»<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Mu dellooti ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">«Santleen Boroom bi, yéen waa àddina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">te ñëw màggal ko, yéen xeet yépp.»<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Te it Esayi wax na ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">«Am na sëtu Isayi buy ñëw,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">dina yilif xeeti ñi dul Yawut,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">te ci moom lañuy wékk seen yaakaar.»<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Kon Yàlla miy maye yaakaar, na def ci seen xol mbég mu réy ak jàmm ju yaa ci seen kaw ngëm, ba ngeen am yaakaar ju mat sëkk ci dooley Xel mu Sell mi.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Li waral Pool ñemee waxe noonu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Bokk yi, wóor na ma ne baax ngeen ba fa mbaax mana yem, fees dell ak xam-xam, ba mana jàngleente mbiri Yàlla ci seen biir. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Bu sama kàddu diisee nag ci bataaxal bii, dara taxul lu dul bëgga yeesal seen xalaat, ndaxte Yàlla ci kaw yiwam daf maa sas, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />ma nekk jawriñu Kirist Yeesu, yebal ma ci àddina ci xeeti ñi dul Yawut. Liggéey bu sell laay def ngir Yàlla, ci xamle xibaaru jàmmam bi, ngir xeeti àddina sell ci dooley Xel mu Sell mi, ba neex Yàlla, mel ni sarax su ñu koy jébbal. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Kon nag maa ngi bànneexu ci Kirist Yeesu ngir liggéey boobu ma Yàlla dénk. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Awma fitu wax leneen nag, lu dul li Kirist jëf jaarale ko ci man, ngir xeeti àddina jébbalu ci moom; jëf na jaarale ci samay wax ak samay jëf, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />ci ay tegtal ak i kéemaan, sukkandikoo ci dooley Xelu Yàlla mi. Ba fi mu nekk nag yégle naa fu nekk xibaaru Kirist, li dale ci Yerusalem, jaar ci gox yépp, ba àgg diiwaanu Iliri. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Sama yéene mooy xamle xibaaru turu Kirist fa mu eggagul, ndax bëggumaa yeggale sas wu keneen daloon. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Li ma def nag, dëppoo na ak li Mbind mi wax ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">«Ñi yégagul mbiram dinañu ko yég,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">te ñi ko masula dégg, xam ko.»<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool fas na yéeney dem dëkku Room</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Bëggoon naa ñëw seetsi leen, fekk ay téq-téq ñoo ma téye ba tey. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Waaye nag léegi bey naa sama sas ci gox yii. <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Bu may dem Espaañ nag, bëgg naa faa jaar, nuyu leen; ndaxte ay at a ngii maa ngi am yéene ju tar ci ñëw seetsi leen. Bëgg na maa nekk ci seen biir, ngir am bànneexu sotteente ak yéen xalaat ab diir, te it ngeen waajalal ma sama yoonu Espaañ. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Waaye nag fi mu nekk maa ngi dem nii Yerusalem, ngir dimbaliji gaayi Yàlla yu sell ya fa nekk. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Ndaxte waa Maseduwan ak waa Akayi ñi gëm, fas nañu yéeney sàkk ci seeni alal, yónnee ko, ngir dimbali ñi néew doole ci gaayi Yàlla yu sell, yi nekk Yerusalem. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Yéene nañu ko, te it ci dëgg-dëgg bor la, bu ñu wara fey. Ndaxte gannaaw ñi gëm ci Yerusalem séddoo nañu ak ñi dul Yawut seen ngëm, kon xeet yooyu itam war nañoo séddoo ak ñoom seen alal. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Kon nag waxtu wu ma noppee ci liggéey boobu, ba teg may gu tedd gii ci loxoy boroom, dinaa dem Espaañ, tey jaar fi yéen. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Te wóor na maa ne bu ma agsee ci yéen, dinaa indaale barkeb Kirist bu mat sëkk.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Gannaaw loolu bokk yi, maa ngi leen di ñaan ci turu sunu Boroom Yeesu Kirist ak ci bëggante, gi Xelu Yàlla mi def ci nun, ngeen defal ma lii: àndleen ak man, nu tuur sunu ñaq ci ñaan Yàlla. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Ñaanal-leen ma, ngir ma mucc ci ñi gëmul ci waa Yude; te it gaayi Yàlla yu sell yu nekk ci Yerusalem nangu ndimbal, li ma leen di yóbbul. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Dolli ci, Yàlla may ma, ma ñëw seetsi leen ak xol bu sedd, nu booloo yeeslu fa kanam Yàlla. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Yal na Yàlla miy Boroom jàmm ànd ak yéen ñépp. Amiin.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Pool a ngi nuyu waa Room</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Bu nu weesoo loolu, maa ngi leen di dénk sunu jigéen Febe, miy liggéeyal mbooloom ñi gëm ci dëkku Señsere. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Nangeen ko jàpp ci turu Boroom bi, ni ko gaayi Yàlla yi yelloo, te dimbali ko ci lépp lu mu aajowoo, ndaxte moom itam wax dëgg, dimbali na ñu bare, ba ci man mii di wax ak yéen.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Nuyul-leen ma Pirsil ak Akilas, samay nawle ci liggéeyu Kirist Yeesu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Ñoom ñaar dem nañu, bay bëgga jaay seen bakkan ngir man; maa ngi leen di gërëm ci loolu, du man rekk sax, waaye itam mboolooy ñi gëm ci xeeti àddina sépp.<verse eid="ROM 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Nuyul-leen ma it ñiy booloo ci seen kër.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="ROM 16:5">Maa ngi nuyu it Epaynet, mi jëkka gëm Kirist ci diiwaanu Asi; <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />ak Maryaama, mi sonnoon lool ci yéen.<verse eid="ROM 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Nuyul-leen ma it Andoronikus ak Yuñas, sama bokk, yi ñu ma booleeloon tëj; am nañu tur ci ndawi Yàlla yi, te ñoo ma jiitu sax ci gëm Kirist.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Te fàttewuma Ampilyaatus, mi ma bëgg ci sama xol ngir Boroom bi.<verse eid="ROM 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Nuyul-leen ma it Urban, sunu nawle ci liggéeyu Kirist, ak sama soppe Estakis; <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />ak it Apeles, mi ngëmam dëggu, ba yelloo kóolute.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="ROM 16:10">Nuyul-leen ma it waa kër Aristobul, <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />ak Erojon sama mbokk, ak waa kër Narsis, ñi ci Boroom bi.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Maa ngi nuyu Tirifen, moom ak Tirifos, jigéen ñi sonn ci liggéeyu Boroom bi, ak it sama soppe Persidd, mi ci jeex tàkk.<verse eid="ROM 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Maa ngi nuyu it Rufus, waa ji xolam seey ci Boroom bi, ak yaayam, mi ma féete woon it cérub ndey. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Te fàttewuma Asànkirit, Felegon, Ermes, Patarobas, Ermas, ñoom ak mboolem bokk yépp.<verse eid="ROM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Nuyul-leen ma it Filolog ak Yuli, Nere ak jigéenam.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="ROM 16:15">Te fàttewuma Olimpas ak gaayi Yàlla yiy booloo ak ñoom ñépp.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Te yéen bokk yi, saafoonteleen ak xol bu laab. Mboolooy ñi gëm Kirist yépp a ngi leen di nuyu.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moytuleen ñi leen di réeral</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Bokk yi, maa ngi leen di dénk, ngeen moytu ñi leen di féewale, ba di leen jàddloo yoon wi, ciy wax lu juuyoo ak dëgg gi ngeen jàng. Dawleen leen ba sore. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Ndax ñu deme noonu liggéeyaluñu Kirist sunu Boroom; seen bopp lañuy liggéeyal. Ñu ngi ñëw ak làmmiñ yu neex, di jay xol yu woyof yi, ba nax leen. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Waaye seen dégg ndigal bir na ñépp, ba sama xol sedd lool ci yéen. Teewul nag damaa bëgg ngeen am xam-xam bu leer ci lu baax, te baña laal dara ci lu bon. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Su ko defee Yàlla Boroom jàmm dina not Seytaane ci seeni tànk léegi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Yal na yiwu Yeesu sunu Boroom ànd ak yéen!<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timote sama nawle bi may jàpple ci liggéey bi, mu ngi leen di nuyu, ak samay bokk Lusiyus, Yason ak Sosipater.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Man Tersiyus mi bind bataaxal bii nag, maa ngi leen di nuyu ci turu Boroom bi.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayus mu ngi leen di nuyu; moo may ganale ci këram, te foofa it la mbooloo mi di dajaloo. Erast miy topptoo mbiri xaalisu dëkk bi it, nuyu na leen, ak sunu mbokk Kartus.<verse eid="ROM 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Yal na yiwu sunu Boroom Yeesu Kirist ànd ak yéen! Amiin.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yàlla yelloo na ndam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Santleen Yàlla, mi leen mana saxal bu wér ci dëggu xibaaru jàmm, bi may waare ci mbirum Yeesu Kirist! Nekkoon na kumpa gu làqu diirub ay ati at, <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />waaye léegi nag Yàlla dindi na nu ci kumpa. Santaane na, nu yégle xibaar boobu ci xeeti àddina sépp, ci firi Mbindi yonent yi, ngir nit ñi man koo gëm, ba jébbalu.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Yàlla mi jagoo xam-xam bépp, moom rekk moo yelloo ndam ba fàww, jaar ci Yeesu Kirist! Amiin.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>